{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_grovesinger","model_identifier":"elf_grovesinger","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_grovesinger\n\nElf grovesinger (A3), mage, 1.9 m = 68 u (crown to 71).\n\nElf mage (androgynous; reads as male or female) in an ankle-length white robe with a moss-green, leaf-cut over-robe, sash, and a crown of twigs with leaf sprigs. Casts with a gnarled living-wood staff (1.8 m) with a few living leaves and a glowing seed held in a claw of wood at the top. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 39 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..71.0, z -6.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 70 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | staff upright at the right side |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `cast_rootbind` | 1.6 | once | key 0.80 s: staff butt strikes the ground (spawn roots at the target) |\n| `cast_thorn_volley` | 1.1 | once | key 0.50 s: left arm releases the throw (spawn the thorn projectile at slot_hand_l) |\n| `cast_barkskin` | 1.6 | once | key 0.90 s: staff at its highest (apply the buff) |\n| `cast_mending_bloom` | 2 | once | key 1.10 s: palm touches the ground (flowers spring up) |\n| `cast_call_of_the_wild` | 1.8 | once | key 0.90 s: head fully back, mid-call (play the call) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n- `run`: 149.3 u/s (4.20 m/s), cycle 0.62 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_rootbind`: key 0.80 s: staff butt strikes the ground (spawn roots at the target)\n- `cast_thorn_volley`: key 0.50 s: left arm releases the throw (spawn the thorn projectile at slot_hand_l)\n- `cast_barkskin`: key 0.90 s: staff at its highest (apply the buff)\n- `cast_mending_bloom`: key 1.10 s: palm touches the ground (flowers spring up)\n- `cast_call_of_the_wild`: key 0.90 s: head fully back, mid-call (play the call)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `living_staff` (visible, under slot_hand_r): about 1.8 m (64 u), grip at the origin, top (glowing seed) 40 u along item -Z, butt 24 u along +Z. The `glow_seed` cube is the glowing seed (light it in game)\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- cast_rootbind: second grip (left hand) 12 u above the right hand on the staff\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_grovesinger_silver.png`: silver hair\n- `elf_grovesinger_gold.png`: pale gold hair\n- `elf_grovesinger_black.png`: black hair\n"},"description":"# elf_grovesinger\n\nElf grovesinger (A3), mage, 1.9 m = 68 u (crown to 71).\n\nElf mage (androgynous; reads as male or female) in an ankle-length white robe with a moss-green, leaf-cut over-robe, sash, and a crown of twigs with leaf sprigs. Casts with a gnarled living-wood staff (1.8 m) with a few living leaves and a glowing seed held in a claw of wood at the top. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 39 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..71.0, z -6.0..4.5 (fa